  - text: Quick! Use our gold to place an arrow tower!
    closable: 1
    overidden: 1
    viewTime: 0
  - text: Good job! But that was a scouting party...
    closable: 0
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 5
  - text: Smart buggers to target our defenses
    closable: 0
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 5
  - text: Keep defeating enemies to get gold
    closable: 1
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 0
  - text: We spotted a heavily armored force!
    closable: 0
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 5
  - text: Build cannons to blast through their armor!
    closable: 1
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 0
  - text: I've got a report of a fast strike force!
    closable: 0
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 5
  - text: Quick, build a magic tower to wipe the wave!
    closable: 1
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 0
  - text: The leader is approaching! Destroy the remaining enemies!
    closable: 0
    overidden: 0
    viewTime: 5
